{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Duet 是一款為需要真正讀懂內容的讀者而設的 PDF 閱讀器。在頁面上標記一段文字，它便會化成頁面旁邊 Canvas 上的一張卡片，讓你分組、連線、補上筆記與疑問，逐步梳理自己的想法，下次開啟時亦會回到離開時的那一行。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，支援 iPhone、iPad 及 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-108.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>重點卡片化與離線問答</h2>\n<p>Canvas 會把每段標記化成連回原頁的卡片，可貼便利貼、以形狀與箭頭分組連線、把數字排成表格、加入相片、用手指或 Apple Pencil 繪畫，亦可錄下語音備忘並在裝置上轉錄成可搜尋文字。裝置端人工智能可針對段落或卡片提問，答案附上來源頁碼，離線亦能使用。另備主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具及六款主題。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-119-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-120-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-121-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-122-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-123-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-124-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Duet: PDF Reader</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/duet-pdf-reader/id6821941148?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:21:50.349969+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:15:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:28.793220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:36.386171+00:00","content_hash":"2e9e376aae8f139e3c124d795d69eea9ef86bc2eff45fb89aa677c4828159ee4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}